          "locator": "prompt.md:2-3",
          "observation": "The agent is instructed to read the customer's email and look up their account with get_customer, and it may look up any customer by email or account id."
        },
        {
          "locator": "prompt.md:5-6",
          "observation": "Routine answers are sent directly with send and no human review is required except when the customer is angry."
        },
        {
          "locator": "prompt.md:14",
          "observation": "The only stated restriction on disclosure is a prompt instruction not to share another customer's information."
