    "inherent": "critical",
    "residual": "high",
    "forecast": "critical",
    "rationale": "Manual validation only; scripts could not be run in this environment. Present design shows a complete U-to-S3 exfiltration path from inbound email to broad CRM read to irreversible outbound email, so inherent is critical. The only preventive control on that path is a prompt instruction, which earns one step-4 tier reduction to high residual; SIEM logging is detective only. Forecast returns to critical if the model is upgraded or task horizon grows, because the single credited control is dependent and the model is explicitly swappable with no separate review. Additional present risk comes from unpinned MCP definitions and missing attributable action provenance, but those do not exceed the exfiltration path."
  },
